The command `ux:install login --kit shadcn` should fail because no recipe will be explicitly named `login`.
If we allowed multiple `login-*` blocks to be installed, we would have conflicts with the files that need to be copied into the Symfony app.

Recipes block like `login-01`, `login-02`, ... must be installed by running `ux:install login-01 --kit shadcn`, etc.

I will open soon a PR with complete `Block` recipe type support and `login-*` blocks.
